WEBVTT

00:16:27.872 --> 00:16:30.742
stop with the struggle of for and against?

00:16:30.766 --> 00:16:32.976
No, absolutely not. I'm not saying that.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:35.976
This is an amazing group of people
who are doing so much,

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.738
using so much of their talent,

00:16:37.762 --> 00:16:39.820
their brilliance,
their energy, their money,

00:16:39.844 --> 00:16:41.440
to make the world a better place,

00:16:41.464 --> 00:16:43.195
to fight wrongs,

00:16:43.219 --> 00:16:44.499
to solve problems.

00:16:45.856 --> 00:16:48.176
But as we learned from Samantha Power

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:53.008
in her story about Sérgio Vieira de Mello,

00:16:53.032 --> 00:16:57.277
you can't just go charging in,
saying, "You're wrong, and I'm right,"

00:16:57.301 --> 00:17:00.714
because, as we just heard,
everybody thinks they are right.